msgstr "管理员 TURN"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_admin_channels.html.heex:54
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_admin_console.html.heex:35
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Admin Users"
msgstr "管理员用户"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_admin_users.html.heex:2
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Admin Users is the server-wide user administration window. Open it from File > Admin > Users; it opens as a desktop window you can drag, resize, minimize to the taskbar, and close with its title-bar X. It gathers everything you can do about a person: moderating them, changing their account, and administering their NickServ registration."
msgstr "管理用户是全服务器的用户管理窗口。从 File > Admin > Users 打开;它作为桌面窗口打开,您可以拖动、调整大小、最小化到任务栏,并通过标题栏的 X 关闭。它汇集了您可以对一个人执行的所有操作:管理其行为、更改其账户,以及管理其 NickServ 注册。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_admin_users.html.heex:22
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Ban, Unban, Kick, Mute and Unmute each take their own nick, so acting on several people in a row never applies an action to a stale selection. Ban accepts an optional reason and duration; Kick accepts a reason; Mute accepts a duration. Leaving a duration blank makes the action permanent."
msgstr "Ban、Unban、Kick、Mute 和 Unmute 各自需要填写昵称,因此连续对多人操作时不会把操作误用到过期的选择上。Ban 接受可选的原因和时长;Kick 接受原因;Mute 接受时长。时长留空则操作永久生效。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_admin_channels.html.heex:34
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "ChanServ admin"
msgstr "ChanServ 管理"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_admin_channels.html.heex:36
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "ChanServ info reads a registration and Access list reads its SOP/AOP/VOP entries. Add access and Remove access take a nick and a level. Transfer founder hands the channel to another nick. Drop registration deletes the registration and is not reversible."
msgstr "ChanServ 信息读取注册信息,访问列表读取其 SOP/AOP/VOP 条目。添加访问和移除访问需要填写昵称和级别。转让创建者会把频道交给另一个昵称。删除注册会删除该注册,且不可恢复。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_admin_users.html.heex:57
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Channel Permissions"
msgstr "频道权限"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_admin_motd.html.heex:16
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Clear MOTD removes it entirely — users connecting afterwards see no message of the day until one is set again."
msgstr "清除 MOTD 会将其完全移除——之后连接的用户在重新设置之前不会看到任何每日消息。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_admin_motd.html.heex:14
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Clearing it"
msgstr "清除它"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_admin_channels.html.heex:20
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Creating"
msgstr "创建频道"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_admin_channels.html.heex:29
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Delete removes the channel entirely; Purge deletes its messages and optionally only those from one nick. Both require the channel name typed a second time into the confirm field, and so does Drop registration. The server checks that too — it is not a client-side formality."
msgstr "删除会彻底移除该频道;清除会删除其消息,也可只删除某个昵称的消息。两者都要求在确认栏中再次输入频道名称,删除注册也是如此。服务器同样会检查这一点——这不是客户端的形式。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_admin_channels.html.heex:27
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Destructive actions"
msgstr "破坏性操作"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_admin_console.html.heex:9
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Each line is a slash command, for example"
msgstr "每一行都是一条斜杠命令,例如"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_admin_users.html.heex:15
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Enter a nick in the Nick field and choose Info to run /admin user info for a single account."
msgstr "在昵称栏中输入昵称,然后选择信息,即可对单个账户运行 /admin user info。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_admin_channels.html.heex:15
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Entering a channel in the Channel field and choosing Info runs /admin channel info and also loads that channel's ban list at the bottom of the window. The ban list follows whatever channel you last inspected."
msgstr "在频道栏中输入频道并选择信息,会运行 /admin channel info,并在窗口底部加载该频道的封禁列表。封禁列表会跟随您最近查看的频道。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_admin_console.html.heex:19
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Everything the other admin windows do with forms can be done here as a script. That makes it the tool for provisioning a server in one pass, or for anything the focused windows do not expose."
msgstr "其他管理窗口通过表单完成的所有操作,都可以在这里以脚本方式完成。因此它是一次性配置服务器的工具,也可用于专用窗口未提供的任何操作。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_admin_console.html.heex:24
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Example script"
msgstr "示例脚本"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_admin_channels.html.heex:7
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Finding a channel"
msgstr "查找频道"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_admin_users.html.heex:7
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Finding a user"
msgstr "查找用户"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_admin_console.html.heex:7
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Input format"
msgstr "输入格式"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_admin_users.html.heex:20
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Moderation"
msgstr "管理"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_admin_channels.html.heex:22
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "New channel plus Create runs /admin channel create, which both creates and registers the channel."
msgstr "新建频道加创建会运行 /admin channel create,该命令既创建又注册频道。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_admin_users.html.heex:34
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "NickServ admin"
msgstr "NickServ 管理"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_admin_users.html.heex:36
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "NickServ info reads a registration, Reset password sets a new one without knowing the old, and Drop registration deletes it. Dropping is not reversible."
msgstr "NickServ 的“信息”用于查看一条注册信息,“重置密码”无需知道旧密码即可设置新密码,“删除注册”会将其删除。删除后无法恢复。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_admin_console.html.heex:28
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Only server administrators and server operators can open it. The console runs under a privileged context that forces admin rights and lifts the per-user channel limit, so that gate is the only thing between a caller and privileged execution."
msgstr "只有服务器管理员和服务器操作员才能打开。控制台在特权上下文中运行,会强制使用管理员权限并解除每个用户的频道数量限制,因此这道门槛是调用者与特权执行之间唯一的屏障。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_admin_channels.html.heex:43
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_admin_users.html.heex:43
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Only server administrators and server operators can open this window. Server operators see it read-only: the controls are disabled, and the server refuses the action even if the control is bypassed."
msgstr "只有服务器管理员和服务器操作员才能打开此窗口。服务器操作员看到的是只读界面:控件已被禁用,即使绕过控件,服务器也会拒绝该操作。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_admin_server_settings.html.heex:23
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Only server administrators may edit. Server operators can open the window and read the panes, but every control is disabled and the server refuses the change regardless."
msgstr "只有服务器管理员可以编辑。服务器操作员可以打开窗口并查看各个面板,但所有控件都被禁用,服务器同样会拒绝任何更改。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_admin_motd.html.heex:23
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Only server administrators may edit. Server operators can read the current message but the editor and both write buttons are disabled."
msgstr "只有服务器管理员可以编辑。服务器操作员可以查看当前消息,但编辑器和两个写入按钮都被禁用。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_admin_audit_log.html.heex:16
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Only server administrators may refresh. The window is read-only for everyone: there is nothing here to change."
msgstr "只有服务器管理员可以刷新。该窗口对所有人都是只读的:这里没有可更改的内容。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_admin_server_settings.html.heex:14
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Reading it back"
msgstr "回读结果"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_admin_audit_log.html.heex:7
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Reading the log"
msgstr "查看日志"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_admin_users.html.heex:29
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Rename changes a registered nickname. Set role assigns server_operator or removes admin roles by setting user. Only a root administrator can grant the admin role — the option is disabled for everyone else."
msgstr "“重命名”用于更改已注册的昵称。“设置角色”可指定 server_operator,或通过设置为 user 来移除管理员角色。只有根管理员才能授予管理员角色——对其他人此选项已被禁用。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_admin_broadcast.html.heex:16
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Server operators may send wallops. Announce is administrators only, and the radio is disabled for anyone else. If neither is available the Send button is disabled entirely."
msgstr "服务器操作员可以发送 wallops。“公告”仅限管理员使用,对其他人该单选项已被禁用。如果两者都不可用,“发送”按钮将被完全禁用。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_admin_motd.html.heex:7
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Setting it"
msgstr "设置方法"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_admin_turn.html.heex:14
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Snapshots, not a feed"
msgstr "抓图,不是 订阅源"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_admin_console.html.heex:2
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The Admin Console is a batch command runner. Open it from File > Admin > Console; it opens as a desktop window you can drag, resize, minimize to the taskbar, and close with its title-bar X."
msgstr "管理员控制台是一个批量命令执行器。从“文件 > 管理 > 控制台”打开;它以桌面窗口的形式打开,你可以拖动、调整大小、最小化到任务栏,也可以用标题栏的 X 关闭。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_admin_danger_zone.html.heex:16
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The button stays disabled until you type the server's current name. The server checks the same thing when the form is submitted, so a stale button is never what authorizes a wipe — if the server was renamed after the preview loaded, the submission is refused."
msgstr "在你输入服务器当前名称之前,该按钮一直处于禁用状态。提交表单时服务器也会进行同样的检查,因此过期的按钮永远不会授权清除操作——如果在预览加载后服务器被重命名,提交将被拒绝。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_admin_danger_zone.html.heex:14
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The confirmation"
msgstr "确认步骤"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_admin_server_settings.html.heex:9
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The form writes the server's configuration record: name, description, welcome message, channel limit, registration policy and how long whowas entries are kept. Saving dispatches one change per field you actually altered, so the result strip can report several lines at once."
msgstr "该表单会写入服务器的配置记录:名称、描述、欢迎消息、频道数量限制、注册策略,以及 whowas 条目的保留时长。保存时,你实际修改的每个字段都会各自提交一次更改,因此结果栏可以同时报告多行结果。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_admin_channels.html.heex:9
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The list reads /admin channel list as a point-in-time snapshot — it does not update on its own. Type into Search before choosing Refresh to narrow it."
msgstr "列表读作/admin频道列表作为时点快照——它不会自行更新. 在选择刷新缩小前输入搜索 。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_admin_users.html.heex:9
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The list reads /admin user list as a point-in-time snapshot — it does not update on its own. Type into Search and tick Online only before choosing Refresh to narrow it. The ban list below reads /admin user banlist under the same search term, so filtering the list filters both."
msgstr "该列表读取 /admin user list 的结果,是某一时刻的快照——不会自动更新。选择“刷新”之前,可在“搜索”中输入内容并勾选“仅在线”来缩小范围。下方的封禁列表在相同的搜索词下读取 /admin user banlist,因此筛选列表会同时筛选两者。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_admin_turn.html.heex:16
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The numbers are from the last time Refresh ran. Nothing here updates on its own."
msgstr "数字来自上一次刷新。这里的内容不会自动更新。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_admin_motd.html.heex:9
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The pane at the top shows the message that is set right now, so you can see what you are about to replace. Set MOTD writes the editor's contents; submitting an empty editor is the same as clearing."
msgstr "顶部的面板显示当前已设置的消息,方便你看到即将替换的内容。“设置 MOTD”会写入编辑器中的内容;提交空编辑器等同于清除。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_admin_server_settings.html.heex:16
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The two panes below the form show what the server reports right now, from /admin server info and /admin server settings. Refresh re-reads both without leaving the window."
msgstr "表单下方的两个面板显示服务器当前报告的内容,分别来自 /admin server info 和 /admin server settings。“刷新”会同时重新读取两者,无需离开窗口。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_admin_audit_log.html.heex:9
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The window reads /admin log as a point-in-time snapshot — it does not follow new entries. Last bounds how many rows come back, and User narrows it to one admin. Leaving Last blank falls back to 20 rather than asking for everything."
msgstr "该窗口读取 /admin log 的结果,是某一时刻的快照——不会跟随新条目。“最近”限制返回的行数,“用户”可缩小到某一位管理员。“最近”留空时默认为 20,而不是返回全部。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_admin_broadcast.html.heex:7
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Two reaches"
msgstr "两种范围"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_admin_turn.html.heex:9
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Two read-only panes: relay statistics and the allocations currently held. If no TURN relay is configured the stats pane says so rather than showing zeros."
msgstr "两个只读面板:中继统计和当前持有的分配。如果没有配置 TURN 中继,统计面板会如实说明,而不是显示零。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_admin_broadcast.html.heex:9
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Wallops goes only to users who opted in with mode +w. Announce goes to everyone connected, whether they asked for it or not — reserve it for things people genuinely need to see."
msgstr "Wallops 只发送给通过模式 +w 选择接收的用户。“公告”会发送给所有已连接的人,无论他们是否愿意接收——请仅用于人们确实需要看到的内容。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_admin_danger_zone.html.heex:7
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "What a wipe removes"
msgstr "清除会移除什么"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_admin_server_settings.html.heex:7
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "What it edits"
msgstr "可编辑的内容"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_admin_turn.html.heex:7
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "What it shows"
msgstr "显示的内容"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_admin_console.html.heex:17
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Why use it"
msgstr "为什么要用它"

